WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:21.645
"Let's race!" Zippy said.

2
00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:32.073
He zoomed off.

3
00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:38.140
Eddy drove fast.

4
00:00:38.141 --> 00:00:45.300
He zipped around a bend.

5
00:00:45.301 --> 00:00:49.570
Eddy saw Zippy.

6
00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:54.640
Zippy was reading another sign.

7
00:00:54.641 --> 00:00:59.518
Everyone else stopped.

8
00:00:59.519 --> 00:01:03.813
"What does the sign say?" Gasser asked.

9
00:01:03.814 --> 00:01:10.229
"It says, 'Dig!'" Zippy said.

10
00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:13.347
"Hmm," Poppy said.

11
00:01:13.348 --> 00:01:20.957
"Where will we dig?"

12
00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:24.210
"I know where to dig," Jeb said.

13
00:01:24.211 --> 00:01:31.497
"At the construction site!"

14
00:01:31.498 --> 00:01:47.825
Everyone went to the construction site.

15
00:01:47.826 --> 00:02:00.966
Jeb dug.

16
00:02:00.967 --> 00:02:04.564
He dug deep.

17
00:02:04.565 --> 00:02:09.281
He dug up a box.

18
00:02:09.282 --> 00:02:12.152
Poppy opened the box.

19
00:02:12.153 --> 00:02:14.955
"It's a horn," she said.

20
00:02:14.956 --> 00:02:17.596
"Another clue," Eddy said.

21
00:02:17.597 --> 00:02:22.412
"Honk the horn, Poppy."

22
00:02:22.413 --> 00:02:32.087
Honk! Poppy honked the horn.

23
00:02:32.088 --> 00:02:35.462
Nothing happened.

24
00:02:35.463 --> 00:02:38.446
Eddy sighed.

25
00:02:38.447 --> 00:02:42.972
"Now what do we do?"
